{"id":"b653ee0494f3a15d","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-zfc-rel-composition.md","title":"ZFC Rel Composition","display":"df-zfc-rel-composition — ZFC Rel Composition","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-rel-composition","aliases":["58-df-zfc-rel-composition"],"display":"df-zfc-rel-composition — ZFC Rel Composition","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-relation-composition.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-relation.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-rel-composition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-rel-composition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-rel-composition — ZFC Rel Composition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7e70202d5fff2308\" href=\"?note=7e70202d5fff2308\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-relation-composition.md\">../batch17/58-df-relation-composition.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7ccfc8c88f29968a\" href=\"?note=7ccfc8c88f29968a\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-relation.md\">../batch18/58-df-relation.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,C,R,S,T\\in V\">\\(A,B,C,R,S,T\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rel}_S(R,A,B)\">\\(\\mathrm{Rel}_S(R,A,B)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rel}_S(S,B,C)\">\\(\\mathrm{Rel}_S(S,B,C)\\)</span> are typed relations, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\circ R\">\\(S\\circ R\\)</span> is their composition (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7e70202d5fff2308\" href=\"?note=7e70202d5fff2308\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-relation-composition.md\">../batch17/58-df-relation-composition.md</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7ccfc8c88f29968a\" href=\"?note=7ccfc8c88f29968a\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-relation.md\">../batch18/58-df-relation.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRelComposition}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRelComposition}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rel\\text{-}composition} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRelComposition}_S(T,S,R)\\leftrightarrow \\exists A,B,C\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Rel}_S(R,A,B)\\land\\mathrm{Rel}_S(S,B,C)\\land T=S\\circ R\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rel\\text{-}composition} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRelComposition}_S(T,S,R)\\leftrightarrow \\exists A,B,C\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Rel}_S(R,A,B)\\land\\mathrm{Rel}_S(S,B,C)\\land T=S\\circ R\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-relation-composition.md","status":"resolved","id":"7e70202d5fff2308","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-relation-composition.md]]","e